<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine posts $548.7 mln trade deficit Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine posts $548.7 mln trade deficit Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $548.7 million in the first 10 months of this year, the Statistics Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Sep 96  Jan-Oct 95  Exports (bln $)		11.443	10.125	9.111</p>
<p> Imports (bln $)		11.991	10.968	8.684</p>
<p> Trade balance (million $)	-548.7	-842.9	+427.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries.</p>
<p>Trade with former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $912 million, compared to a deficit of $1.17 billion from January to September.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 22 64</p>
